      {
        "y": 93.2,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 321.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A Collocations with compliment and praise"
      },
      {
        "y": 110.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 435.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The boss would get better results if she paid her staff compliments occasionally."
      },
      {
        "y": 122.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 470.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "He asked us what we thought of his suit, but he was really only fishing for compliments."
      },
      {
        "y": 134.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 467.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Take it as a compliment that he feels relaxed enough to fall asleep at your dinner party!"
      },
      {
        "y": 146.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 497.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A back-handed compliment and a double-edged compliment are ones that appear to be both"
      },
      {
        "y": 159.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 511.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "positive and negative. Back-handed compliments tend to have a malicious intent, whereas double-"
      },
      {
        "y": 171.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 269.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "edged ones are usually made innocently."
      },
      {
        "y": 182.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 450.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I took it as a back-handed compliment when he said I was looking good for my age."
      },
      {
        "y": 194.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 504.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "She paid me the double-edged compliment of saying my driving was pretty good for a beginner."
      },
      {
        "y": 206.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 518.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The phrase give praise to is usually used only (though not exclusively) for a god. An action or person"
      },
      {
        "y": 218.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 425.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "that deserves praise is praiseworthy and people are praised for their actions."
      },
      {
        "y": 230.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 266.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Other common collocations are widely/"
      },
      {
        "y": 242.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 286.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "highly praised, praised to the skies, to sing"
      },
      {
        "y": 248.8,
        "x0": 326.8,
        "x1": 435.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Common mistakes"
      },
